Not distributed
===============
This repository does not contain, and must not contain: vendor engine
libraries, vendor filter snapshots, vendor parameter tables, vendor device
metadata, third-party pre-trained model weights, or any file extracted from
a device or an application package. Model files that are not part of this
repository cause the related processing path to fall back automatically.
